{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>On this moon, survival depends on teamwork...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>but you can't trust anyone. While you fight alien monsters back-to-back, someone on your team is already plotting against you.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681820/extras/7506ba8450c5ce24cc5d14c6508fe791.poster.avif?t=1756381797\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681820/extras/7506ba8450c5ce24cc5d14c6508fe791.webm?t=1756381797\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681820/extras/7506ba8450c5ce24cc5d14c6508fe791.mp4?t=1756381797\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MoonMiners</strong> is a cooperative survival simulator that transports you to a bleak sci-fi future on the Moon. Imagine: you and your team manage to deliver the last box of ore when suddenly the power goes out, bugs crawl into the base, and someone blocks the airlock from the inside \u2014 and you realize that there is a traitor among you. You play as a team of space miners working for a ruthless megacorporation far from Earth. Doing your job here can be even harder than just surviving... and that's no exaggeration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What awaits you? In <strong>MoonMiners</strong>, you are part of a mining crew tasked with meeting the corporate mining quota at all costs. Each game is a separate mission on a dangerous lunar base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681820/extras/017ed48ffae15b4d63454a6be1b105dc.poster.avif?t=1756381797\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681820/extras/017ed48ffae15b4d63454a6be1b105dc.webm?t=1756381797\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681820/extras/017ed48ffae15b4d63454a6be1b105dc.mp4?t=1756381797\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restore the base, assign responsibilities, scan and analyze deposits, and follow strict corporate protocols for resource extraction. Process and deliver materials while facing increasing threats, from aggressive alien life forms to a hidden traitor with personal goals: sabotage, disorganization, or even murder.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players load ore into crates, one quietly steals it and throws it into a crater \u2014 an example of a traitor's work, where the team works together to repair damaged infrastructure, extract the necessary resources, and ultimately try to fulfill the corporation's strict plan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681820/extras/95fec33d4f55c8b4832fb84a331b23c5.poster.avif?t=1756381797\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681820/extras/95fec33d4f55c8b4832fb84a331b23c5.webm?t=1756381797\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681820/extras/95fec33d4f55c8b4832fb84a331b23c5.mp4?t=1756381797\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Basic mechanics.</strong> Restore base systems, assign roles, and scan the ground for valuable deposits. Follow strict protocols: extract and process ore, prepare cargo for shipment \u2014 all under constant pressure from external and internal threats. Predatory alien creatures are creeping in from all sides, and somewhere among you, a secret saboteur may be lurking with their own agenda \u2014 to sabotage or quietly eliminate their colleagues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681820/extras/228fa3cb3206eaff56565a2bc9eb8207.poster.avif?t=1756381797\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681820/extras/228fa3cb3206eaff56565a2bc9eb8207.webm?t=1756381797\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681820/extras/228fa3cb3206eaff56565a2bc9eb8207.mp4?t=1756381797\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique features.</strong> The game throws up unpredictable situations that make each session special. Friendly fire is always on \u2014 your mistakes or chaotic shootouts can be just as dangerous as the monsters themselves. Use any equipment at the base, including lunar rovers, to move faster across the surface and transport your loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to take on the treacherous Moon? Gather a team (or go solo), add MoonMiners to your wish list, and get ready to prove you can survive this shift to the end! Survive, meet your quota... or become the next name on the corporation's casualty list.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Blood","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3681820/941e3bb8105c3ba0ce0d5082f9041d804638085b.jpg"},{"name":"Triple Threat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3681820/c91621117c15adaac9591631f2a16f87788adac1.jpg"},{"name":"Moon Massacre","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3681820/c5e0e121ca8c2c4be847bd37d55670d900d13e58.jpg"},{"name":"First Loss","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3681820/37866edea39254aa07b3ac4ae9f766524a625c29.jpg"},{"name":"Twice Fallen","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3681820/6f8444854d6a75e77d543ed0616798f2af204a6b.jpg"},{"name":"Triple Trouble","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3681820/08973f660faaaa76a8183f26fce117f07913a8fb.jpg"},{"name":"First Betrayal Win","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3681820/d49c6aceac270b1edf5e01d07132a698e832f6af.jpg"},{"name":"Double Agent","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3681820/124fb75f9a05106ffea2845e3eb2dbe9d2827b94.jpg"},{"name":"Traitor Supreme","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3681820/cb2e67f6e6ca4d889ec38af40e502b9225ef58e7.jpg"},{"name":"Team Victory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3681820/78359e656ac468a955a1136a1294f9150ce58129.jpg"}],"total":20},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3681820?t=1756381797","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3681820?t=1756381797","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681820/4967e4da690e3d9a3dcbc1a08bb131b477f05cd0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756381797","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681820/4967e4da690e3d9a3dcbc1a08bb131b477f05cd0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756381797","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>On this moon, survival depends on teamwork...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>but you can't trust anyone. While you fight alien monsters back-to-back, someone on your team is already plotting against you.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681820/extras/7506ba8450c5ce24cc5d14c6508fe791.poster.avif?t=1756381797\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681820/extras/7506ba8450c5ce24cc5d14c6508fe791.webm?t=1756381797\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681820/extras/7506ba8450c5ce24cc5d14c6508fe791.mp4?t=1756381797\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MoonMiners</strong> is a cooperative survival simulator that transports you to a bleak sci-fi future on the Moon. Imagine: you and your team manage to deliver the last box of ore when suddenly the power goes out, bugs crawl into the base, and someone blocks the airlock from the inside \u2014 and you realize that there is a traitor among you. You play as a team of space miners working for a ruthless megacorporation far from Earth. Doing your job here can be even harder than just surviving... and that's no exaggeration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What awaits you? In <strong>MoonMiners</strong>, you are part of a mining crew tasked with meeting the corporate mining quota at all costs. Each game is a separate mission on a dangerous lunar base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681820/extras/017ed48ffae15b4d63454a6be1b105dc.poster.avif?t=1756381797\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681820/extras/017ed48ffae15b4d63454a6be1b105dc.webm?t=1756381797\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681820/extras/017ed48ffae15b4d63454a6be1b105dc.mp4?t=1756381797\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restore the base, assign responsibilities, scan and analyze deposits, and follow strict corporate protocols for resource extraction. Process and deliver materials while facing increasing threats, from aggressive alien life forms to a hidden traitor with personal goals: sabotage, disorganization, or even murder.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players load ore into crates, one quietly steals it and throws it into a crater \u2014 an example of a traitor's work, where the team works together to repair damaged infrastructure, extract the necessary resources, and ultimately try to fulfill the corporation's strict plan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681820/extras/95fec33d4f55c8b4832fb84a331b23c5.poster.avif?t=1756381797\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681820/extras/95fec33d4f55c8b4832fb84a331b23c5.webm?t=1756381797\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681820/extras/95fec33d4f55c8b4832fb84a331b23c5.mp4?t=1756381797\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Basic mechanics.</strong> Restore base systems, assign roles, and scan the ground for valuable deposits. Follow strict protocols: extract and process ore, prepare cargo for shipment \u2014 all under constant pressure from external and internal threats. Predatory alien creatures are creeping in from all sides, and somewhere among you, a secret saboteur may be lurking with their own agenda \u2014 to sabotage or quietly eliminate their colleagues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681820/extras/228fa3cb3206eaff56565a2bc9eb8207.poster.avif?t=1756381797\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681820/extras/228fa3cb3206eaff56565a2bc9eb8207.webm?t=1756381797\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681820/extras/228fa3cb3206eaff56565a2bc9eb8207.mp4?t=1756381797\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique features.</strong> The game throws up unpredictable situations that make each session special. Friendly fire is always on \u2014 your mistakes or chaotic shootouts can be just as dangerous as the monsters themselves. Use any equipment at the base, including lunar rovers, to move faster across the surface and transport your loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to take on the treacherous Moon? Gather a team (or go solo), add MoonMiners to your wish list, and get ready to prove you can survive this shift to the end! Survive, meet your quota... or become the next name on the corporation's casualty list.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p>","developers":["MIROWIN"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"descript